Package: uzunyx-openclose
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: kwin-wayland (>= @KWIN@), kwin-wayland (<< @KWIN@.~)
Description: Uzunyx window open and close animation
 KWin effect that animates windows opening and closing: they rise into
 place (up 16 px, from 97 % size, fading in) and sink back out. While it
 animates, the window is drawn above the others, so the closing animation
 isn't hidden by the window that gets the focus, and it replaces KWin's
 maximize animation on apps that open maximized.
 .
 Takes over from KWin's Scale effect for the windows it animates (Scale
 stops on its own). Built against one exact KWin version: KWin refuses to
 load it in any other, so it must be rebuilt after every KWin update.
